      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Metrics:\nPrimary (sole decision making criteria):\n- 7-Day BOF Conversion Rate \n    =>  + 1%\n\nSecondary \n- Adoption rate =>  + 3%\n- Avg. revenue =>  + 2%\n- Customer Support Calls => - 9%\n- Hardware Purchase Rate => + 27%\n- Dashboard engagement => +28%\n- Positive Cost. ratings => 4%\n\nGuard Metrics\n- Ramp up: Bugs, Marketing analytics data, third party risk data\n- Risk : % payment activated in 7 days, Average # of complaints, #fraudulent accounts\n- Customer Experience: # of cases created by sellers, survey response\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Metrics:\nPrimary (sole decision making criteria):\n- 7-Day BOF Conversion Rate \n    =>  + 1%\n\nSecondary \n- Adoption rate =>  + 3%\n- Avg. revenue =>  + 2%\n- Customer Support Calls => - 9%\n- Hardware Purchase Rate => + 27%\n- Dashboard engagement => +28%\n- Positive Cost. ratings => 4%\n\nGuard Metrics\n- Ramp up: Bugs, Marketing analytics data, third party risk data\n- Risk : % payment activated in 7 days, Average # of complaints, #fraudulent accounts\n- Customer Experience: # of cases created by sellers, survey response\n",
